# Axe the Competition (jeuno 59): the offer without the pick. Axe 2400: 12; option 1 with a full inventory (no pick:
# giveItem false, not begun); after a rezone 12 again, option 1: the pick (0 points) and the guide, begun; 15 with the
# pick held (1), option 1: the pick held: nothing; a trade of the 0-point pick: 14 (no finish). A MNK char (cannot equip
# the pick) with Axe 2400: not offered. A char with the guide held (another weapon-skill quest's): not offered. A level
# 70 Warrior with Axe 2400 (the pick is level 71): not offered.
# Brutus's other quests are kept silent for a level 75 Warrior: Chocobo's Wounds and Save My Son completed, Path of
# the Beastmaster accepted (a GM, before login: it has no accepted section; available it would play 70, completed 20),
# Chocobo on the Loose completed (no completed section); his script then starts nothing, and a talk with no
# quest reply plays his default 66 (DefaultActions).
lists UpperJeuno/Brutus/onTrigger UpperJeuno/Brutus/onTrade UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/12 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/15
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-55.5,8.2,97.5 job=WAR lvl=75
char mnk zone=UpperJeuno pos=-55.5,8.2,97.5 job=MNK lvl=75
char guide zone=UpperJeuno pos=-55.5,8.2,97.5 job=WAR lvl=75
char low zone=UpperJeuno pos=-55.5,8.2,97.5 job=WAR lvl=70
skill Axe 2400
mnk: skill Axe 2400
guide: skill Axe 2400
guide: keyitem WeaponTrainingGuide
low: skill Axe 2400
quest Jeuno.ChocobosWounds completed
quest Jeuno.SaveMySon completed
quest Jeuno.PathOfTheBeastmaster accepted
quest Jeuno.ChocoboOnTheLoose completed
mnk: quest Jeuno.ChocobosWounds completed
mnk: quest Jeuno.SaveMySon completed
mnk: quest Jeuno.PathOfTheBeastmaster accepted
mnk: quest Jeuno.ChocoboOnTheLoose completed
guide: quest Jeuno.ChocobosWounds completed
guide: quest Jeuno.SaveMySon completed
guide: quest Jeuno.PathOfTheBeastmaster accepted
guide: quest Jeuno.ChocoboOnTheLoose completed
low: quest Jeuno.ChocobosWounds completed
low: quest Jeuno.SaveMySon completed
low: quest Jeuno.PathOfTheBeastmaster accepted
low: quest Jeuno.ChocoboOnTheLoose completed
login
trigger Brutus                          # 12
fill-inventory
finish option=1                         # no pick, the inventory full: giveItem false, not begun
free-inventory
rezone
trigger Brutus                          # 12 again
finish option=1                         # the pick (0 points) and the guide: begun
trigger Brutus                          # the pick held: 15 (1)
finish option=1                         # option 1, the pick held: nothing
trade Brutus PickOfTrials x1            # 0 points: 14
finish                                  # no 14 finish: the pick kept
mnk: login
mnk: trigger Brutus                     # cannot equip: not offered; the default 66
mnk: finish
guide: login
guide: trigger Brutus                   # the guide held: not offered; the default 66
guide: finish
low: login
low: trigger Brutus                     # level 70 (the Pick of Trials is level 71; canEquipItem checks the level): not offered; the default 66
low: finish
